# 必考词 Unit 08 短语

## 常考短语

- **cultivate a habit**: 培养习惯 — Reading helps cultivate good reading habits. 阅读有助于培养良好的阅读习惯。
- **cure sb. of sth.**: 治愈某人的… — The treatment cured him of his illness. 治疗治愈了他的疾病。
- **out of curiosity**: 出于好奇 — Out of curiosity, she opened the letter. 出于好奇，她打开了信。
- **current affairs**: 时事 — She reads the newspaper to keep up with current affairs. 她读报纸了解时事。
- **go cycling**: 去骑自行车 — We went cycling in the park on Sunday. 星期天我们去公园骑自行车了。
- **do damage to**: 对…造成损害 — The flood did great damage to the crops. 洪水对庄稼造成了巨大损害。
- **debate on/about**: 就…辩论 — They debated on the issue for hours. 他们就这个问题辩论了好几个小时。
- **deceive sb. into doing sth.**: 骗某人做某事 — He was deceived into signing the contract. 他被骗签了合同。
- **decline to do sth.**: 拒绝做某事 — She declined to comment on the issue. 她拒绝对此事发表评论。
- **on the decline**: 在衰退中 — Traditional industries are on the decline. 传统工业在衰退。
- **dedicate oneself to**: 致力于 — He dedicated himself to scientific research. 他致力于科学研究。
- **defeat the purpose of**: 违背…的目的 — Skipping class defeats the purpose of education. 逃课违背了教育的目的。
- **defend sb. from/against**: 保护某人免受 — The army defended the city from attack. 军队保卫城市免受攻击。
- **be defined as**: 被定义为 — Intelligence can be defined as the ability to learn. 智力可被定义为学习的能力。
- **deliberate on/about**: 审议 — The committee will deliberate on the proposal. 委员会将审议这项提案。
- **deliver a speech**: 发表演讲 — The president delivered a speech on education. 总统发表了关于教育的演讲。
- **in demand**: 有需求 — Good programmers are always in demand. 好的程序员总是有需求的。
- **demonstrate against**: 示威反对 — Thousands demonstrated against the war. 数千人示威反对战争。
- **deny doing sth.**: 否认做某事 — He denied stealing the money. 他否认偷了钱。
- **depend on**: 取决于；依靠 — The outcome depends on many factors. 结果取决于很多因素。
